    "body": "Problem:\n`'equalalways'` equalizes windows on split/close, but not when the UI/terminal is resized, so splits drift.\n\nSolution:\nAdd a default `VimResized` handler in the `nvim.equalalways` augroup that runs `CTRL-W_=` when `'equalalways'` is set. Disable with `'noequalalways'` or `:autocmd! nvim.equalalways`.\n\nFixes #41059",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-24T18:42:17Z",
